composition and all unedited content unchanged."},"color":"#5086d3","bgcolor":"#2b333e"},{"id":13,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[2413.9967977435704,375.98934647291674],"size":[300,46],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"采样结果","localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":109},{"label":"VAE","localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":131}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[100]}],"title":"VAE 解码（出图）","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.43.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"color":"#2a6fcf","bgcolor":"#252f3e"},{"id":15,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3192.825799139355,424.4820694331165],"size":[900,1060],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"H3 Ripple · 模型与设置","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# H3 Ripple — 模型下载\n\n安装 [ComfyUI-WepeNerd](https://github.com/WepeNerd/ComfyUI-WepeNerd)，并使用较新版本的 ComfyUI。下面 5 个文件都要下载；目录均相对 ComfyUI 根目录。\n\n### H3 FL2VA 扩散模型 · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n`minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/diffusion_models/`。\n\n### Pika H3 Flex LoRA · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors)\n\n`pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/loras/H3/`。\n\n### H3 Ripple LoRA · [模型页](https://huggingface.co/WepeNerd/H3_Ripple)\n\n`minimax_H3_Ripple-v1.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/loras/H3/`。\n\n### H3 文本编码器 · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n`qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/text_encoders/`。\n\n### H3 视频 VAE · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n\n`minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/vae/`。\n\n### 工作流设置\n\n已启用 Pika H3 Flex LoRA：**6 步 · LCM · simple · CFG 1**。两个 LoRA 强度均为 **1.0**。CLIP 加载器类型为 **minimax**。复制文件后刷新模型列表或重启 ComfyUI，再在各加载器里选中对应文件。\n\n本工作流按上面列出的 Ripple 文件名加载。若下载到的文件名不同，请在 Ripple LoRA 加载器里改选该文件。\n\n### 工作流用法\n\n在 Ripple Clip 里选择视频和镜头。下载标记好的帧，用外部工具编辑，再把每张编辑图上传到对应卡片。Ripple Output 已启用，会保存镜头与对比视频。原视频音频直接复用；本工作流不需要音频 VAE，也不需要单独的图像编辑模型。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# H3 Ripple — 模型下载\n\n安装 [ComfyUI-WepeNerd](https://github.com/WepeNerd/ComfyUI-WepeNerd)，并使用较新版本的 ComfyUI。下面 5 个文件都要下载；目录均相对 ComfyUI 根目录。\n\n### H3 FL2VA 扩散模型 · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n`minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/diffusion_models/`。\n\n### Pika H3 Flex LoRA · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors)\n\n`pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/loras/H3/`。\n\n### H3 Ripple LoRA · [模型页](https://huggingface.co/WepeNerd/H3_Ripple)\n\n`minimax_H3_Ripple-v1.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/loras/H3/`。\n\n### H3 文本编码器 · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n`qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/text_encoders/`。\n\n### H3 视频 VAE · [下载](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n\n`minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`\n\n存放到 `models/vae/`。\n\n### 工作流设置\n\n已启用 Pika H3 Flex LoRA：**6 步 · LCM · simple · CFG 1**。两个 LoRA 强度均为 **1.0**。CLIP 加载器类型为 **minimax**。复制文件后刷新模型列表或重启 ComfyUI，再在各加载器里选中对应文件。\n\n本工作流按上面列出的 Ripple 文件名加载。若下载到的文件名不同，请在 Ripple LoRA 加载器里改选该文件。\n\n### 工作流用法\n\n在 Ripple Clip 里选择视频和镜头。下载标记好的帧，用外部工具编辑，再把每张编辑图上传到对应卡片。Ripple Output 已启用，会保存镜头与对比视频。原视频音频直接复用；本工作流不需要音频 VAE，也不需要单独的图像编辑模型。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":57,"type":"XH_WN_RippleOutput","pos":[2777.320622545896,541.1305178272414],"size":[391.29057898345445,402.4967968970791],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"图像序列","localized_name":"图像序列","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":100},{"label":"改帧数据","localized_name":"改帧数据","name":"ripple","type":"XH_WN_RIPPLE","link":105},{"label":"保存内容","localized_name":"保存内容","name":"save","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"save"},"link":null},{"label":"文件名前缀","localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"label":"显示锚点标记","localized_name":"显示锚点标记","name":"show_anchor_markers","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"show_anchor_markers"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"图像序列","localized_name":"图像序列","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"label":"音频","localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":null},{"label":"帧率","localized_name":"帧率","name":"frame_rate","type":"FLOAT","links":null},{"label":"对比画面","localized_name":"对比画面","name":"comparison","type":"IMAGE","links":[103]}],"title":"XH-改帧结果输出","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"XH_WN_RippleOutput","aux_id":"WepeNerd/ComfyUI-WepeNerd","ver":"510007abd37f800cb51027bce7c3fce0cb7d23bb","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"8.0"}},"widgets_values":["shot + comparison","ripple/edit",false],"widgets_values_named":{"save":"shot + comparison","filename_prefix":"ripple/edit","show_anchor_markers":false},"color":"#2a6fcf","bgcolor":"#252f3e"},{"id":58,"type":"XH_WN_SaveVideo","pos":[3214.078205301894,284.5084985259579],"size":[389.44704654185,634.7724131638095],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"图像序列","localized_name":"图像序列","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":103},{"label":"音频","localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"label":"遮罩","locali